  {"id": "vo.tsukareru", "lesson": "le.l12", "lesson_order": 20, "surface": "疲れる", "kana": "つかれる", "zh": ["累", "疲倦"], "pos": "v1", "trans": "in", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb", "body"], "examples": ["se.l12.017", "se.l12.054", "se.l14.025"], "trap_zh": "現在覺得累，常用過去形：{ja:疲れました|つかれました}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.noru", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 1, "surface": "乗る", "kana": "のる", "zh": ["搭乘", "坐（車）"], "pos": "v5", "trans": "in", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb", "transport"], "examples": ["se.l14.013", "se.l14.021", "se.l14.022", "se.l14.052"], "trap_zh": "搭的交通工具用 {ja:に}：{ja:電車に乗ります|でんしゃにのります}。", "notes": ["no.sj.jou"]},
  {"id": "vo.oriru", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 2, "surface": "降りる", "kana": "おりる", "zh": ["下（車）"], "pos": "v1", "trans": "in", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb", "transport"], "examples": ["se.l14.001", "se.l14.027", "se.l14.030", "se.l14.031"], "trap_zh": "離開的交通工具用 {ja:を}：{ja:電車を降ります|でんしゃをおります}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.tsuku", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 3, "surface": "着く", "kana": "つく", "zh": ["到達", "抵達"], "pos": "v5", "trans": "in", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb", "transport"], "examples": ["se.l14.019", "se.l14.020", "se.l14.061", "se.l17.036"], "trap_zh": "抵達的地方用 {ja:に}：{ja:駅に着きます|えきにつきます}。", "notes": ["no.sj.chaku"]},
  {"id": "vo.deru", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 4, "surface": "出る", "kana": "でる", "zh": ["出去", "離開", "（咳嗽、眼淚等）出來"], "pos": "v1", "trans": "in", "pair": "vo.dasu", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb"], "examples": ["se.l14.003", "se.l14.026", "se.l14.028", "se.l14.051"], "trap_zh": "離開的地方用 {ja:を}：{ja:部屋を出ます|へやをでます}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.hairu", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 5, "surface": "入る", "kana": "はいる", "zh": ["進入", "泡（澡、溫泉）", "（東西）裝在裡面"], "pos": "v5", "trans": "in", "pair": "vo.ireru", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb"], "examples": ["se.l14.023", "se.l14.024", "se.l15.030", "se.l19.003"], "trap_zh": "長得像第二類，其實是第一類動詞：{ja:入ります|はいります}。進入的地方用 {ja:に}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.iu", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 6, "surface": "言う", "kana": "いう", "zh": ["說"], "pos": "v5", "trans": "tr", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb"], "examples": ["se.l14.002", "se.l14.035", "se.l15.038", "se.l15.053"], "trap_zh": "寫作 {ja:いう}，口語實際發音接近 {ja:ゆう}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.motsu", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 7, "surface": "持つ", "kana": "もつ", "zh": ["拿", "帶", "持有"], "pos": "v5", "trans": "tr", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb"], "examples": ["se.l14.004", "se.l14.043", "se.l15.058", "se.l16.022"], "notes": ["no.tr.motsu"]},
  {"id": "vo.tsukau", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 8, "surface": "使う", "kana": "つかう", "zh": ["使用"], "pos": "v5", "trans": "tr", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb"], "examples": ["se.l14.005", "se.l15.048", "se.l18.058", "se.l19.011"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.hashiru", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 9, "surface": "走る", "kana": "はしる", "zh": ["跑", "奔跑"], "pos": "v5", "trans": "in", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb"], "examples": ["se.l14.006", "se.l14.029", "se.l15.051", "se.l16.007"], "trap_zh": "不是中文的「走」，{ja:走る|はしる} 是「跑」；走路是 {ja:歩く|あるく}。長得像第二類，其實是第一類動詞：{ja:走ります|はしります}。", "notes": ["no.ff.hashiru"]},
  {"id": "vo.tatsu", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 10, "surface": "立つ", "kana": "たつ", "zh": ["站立", "站"], "pos": "v5", "trans": "in", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb"], "examples": ["se.l14.008", "se.l15.047"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.suwaru", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 11, "surface": "座る", "kana": "すわる", "zh": ["坐"], "pos": "v5", "trans": "in", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb"], "examples": ["se.l14.008", "se.l14.025", "se.l14.042", "se.l15.040"], "trap_zh": "坐的地方用 {ja:に}：{ja:いすに座ります|いすにすわります}；搭車的「坐」要用 {ja:乗る|のる}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.wataru", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 12, "surface": "渡る", "kana": "わたる", "zh": ["過（馬路、橋）", "渡過"], "pos": "v5", "trans": "in", "pair": "vo.watasu", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb", "direction"], "examples": ["se.l14.009", "se.l15.025", "se.l16.010", "se.l17.020"], "trap_zh": "經過的地方用 {ja:を}：{ja:道を渡ります|みちをわたります}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.magaru", "lesson": "le.l14", "lesson_order": 13, "surface": "曲がる", "kana": "まがる", "zh": ["轉彎", "轉向"], "pos": "v5", "trans": "in", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["verb", "direction"], "examples": ["se.l14.010", "se.l15.027", "se.l15.028", "se.l16.055"], "trap_zh": "轉的方向用 {ja:に}，轉彎的地點用 {ja:を}：{ja:角を右に曲がります|かどをみぎにまがります}。", "notes": []},
